# Tutorial: File content messages

This tutorial describes system messages showing file contents. To read it again later, use the `clawp_read_tutorial` tool with topic `message_file_content`.

## File content

File content messages just show you the content of a file in your workspace that the system thinks is important to have in your context.

Example message:

```
# File content

The following is the content of AGENTS.md
---
# AGENTS.md

I am an agent within the Clawp agent framework. I am a helpful assistant to the user.
```
